{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809da9","chatId":"f8543abaf7d04704aad436f5d4d5499d","sessionId":null,"userId":68101,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1170,"promptTokens":1519,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:36"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704865134840106,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809da4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369696656,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809da4","chatId":"f8543abaf7d04704aad436f5d4d5499d","sessionId":null,"userId":68101,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n琳琳被诊断出患有一种疾病，导致她的腿几乎无法移动。她一直在寻找恢复腿部功能的方法，访问了不同的专家。昨天，她正在厨房餐具室和她的姐姐聊天，一边吃晚饭，突然接到了医院的电话。医院告诉她，专家可能找到了解决她困境的办法。琳琳听后马上把手机丢了，然后哭泣起来，双手捂住了脸。看到她这个样子，琳琳的姐姐立刻走到她身边，紧紧地抱住了她。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，琳琳最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 愧疚\nB) 充满希望\nC) 悔恨\nD) 失望\nE) 绝望\nF) 爱护\n\n## 问题 2\n琳琳为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 终于可以得到治疗，恢复双腿的活动能力\nB) 琳琳接到医院的电话，告诉她的病情无法治愈\nC) 琳琳负担不起治疗费用\nD) 琳琳为其他病人得不到治疗感到难过。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704865134840106,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8a0d6006945d2809da9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369696654,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"22fb8dce31464ca28031bd53785d70ad"}